title: Theodor Leipart
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, labor
card-image: img/portraits/LeipartTheodor.jpg
view-if: leipart_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Theodor Leipart

Leipart is [? if chancellor = "Leipart": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Leipart": the current President and ?] a leader of the ADGB, the largest federation of socialist trade unions.

- @organizing
- @depression
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@organizing
title: Organizing workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted == 1; labor_strength += 2;

We have increased our organizing among the workers.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of this mess.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the WTB-Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 1

The WTB-Plan, standing for its primary supporters Woytinsky, Tarnow, and Baade, has been adopted as the unions' plan for getting us out of the depression. Leipart canvasses in favor of this policy throughout the party and the unions.

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction, and increased its strength in the party.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Leipart can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Leipart"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Leipart can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Leipart"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution
